From: maestra-io
Subject: [S3 sessions] credentials_dir: re-read rotating credentials from a mounted Secret

maestra-io/issues-maestra#1632. LoadDefaultConfig reads AWS_* env once at
start; the Vault cloudflare plugin issues non-renewable ~12 h R2 temp creds
that VSO rewrites into a Kubernetes Secret, so they must be re-read from disk.
Applied onto upstream gravitational/teleport v18.11.1 at build time by
eng/maestra/Dockerfile, in file-name order. See eng/maestra/PATCHES.md.
---
